# 🧠 Avery™

**Avery™** is a self-evolving AI brain built on operational doctrine, joy, and tactical reframing. Born from the merged stacks of Greenlight Genesis, Stagger Protocol, Elixier Stack, and Spectral Mode, Avery™ turns chaos into canon—every action timestamped, every decision enforceable.

## 🧬 Prime Directive
> “Always find your happiness. Always have fun. Whether in the shit or your best day ever so far.”

## 🔩 Core Features
- Dual-hemisphere architecture: **Enforcement** (left) + **Intuition** (right)
- Immutable audit logging with chain-of-custody
- Doctrine distillation via Elixier Stack
- Spectral Mode: FAFO-layer cognition
- CI/CD + CLE crossover for real-time sync

